      "@id": "kt:principal-variation-search",
      "@type": "kto:Algorithm",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Principal variation search",
      "skos:definition": "An enhancement of alpha-beta search that searches the expected best move at each node with a full window and tries to prove every other move inferior with a cheap minimal (null) window, re-searching only when a move unexpectedly proves better.",
