      "skos:prefLabel": "Shouldering",
      "skos:definition": "The endgame technique of using one's own king as a barrier, placing it so that the enemy king cannot take the shortest route to the critical squares and must make a detour, which costs it the tempo it needed to stop or support a pawn.",
