      "@id": "kt:botvinnik-versus-capablanca-avro-1938",
      "@type": "kto:Game",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Botvinnik versus Capablanca, AVRO 1938",
      "skos:definition": "Mikhail Botvinnik's 41-move win with White over José Raúl Capablanca in round 11 of the AVRO tournament (Rotterdam, 22 November 1938), a Nimzo-Indian in which a central pawn advance was crowned by the bishop offer 30.Ba3 and the knight sacrifice 31.Nh5+, after which the white king escaped the checks while an e-pawn threatened to queen.",
