      "@type": "kto:PawnStructure",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Backward pawn",
      "skos:definition": "A pawn that has fallen behind its neighbours on the adjacent files, so that no friendly pawn can protect it and it cannot advance safely because an enemy pawn controls the square in front of it; it is especially weak on a half-open file, and the square in front of it becomes an outpost.",
