      "@id": "kt:rook-on-the-seventh-rank",
      "@type": "kto:StrategicConcept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Rook on the seventh rank",
      "skos:definition": "A rook that has penetrated to the opponent's second rank (White's seventh, Black's second), where it attacks pawns still on their starting squares and confines the enemy king to the back rank. It is one of the most common goals of play on an open file and a frequent winning factor in rook endgames.",
