      "@type": "kto:StrategicConcept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Space advantage",
      "skos:definition": "The advantage of controlling more of the board than the opponent, usually because one side's pawns stand further forward, so that its pieces have more room to manoeuvre while the other side's pieces are cramped behind their own lines.",
      "kto:domain": "middlegame-strategy",
