      "@id": "kt:dragon-variation",
      "@type": "kto:Variation",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Dragon Variation",
      "skos:definition": "The line of the Open Sicilian 1.e4 c5 2.Nf3 d6 3.d4 cxd4 4.Nxd4 Nf6 5.Nc3 g6, in which Black fianchettoes the king's bishop on g7 and castles short; against White's Yugoslav Attack it produces one of the sharpest opposite-side castling races in opening theory.",
      "kto:domain": "openings",
