      "@id": "kt:viswanathan-anand",
      "@type": "kto:Player",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Viswanathan Anand",
      "skos:definition": "Indian grandmaster (born 1969), India's first grandmaster and the fifteenth world chess champion, who won the FIDE title in 2000 and the undisputed title in 2007, defended it in 2008, 2010 and 2012, and lost it to Magnus Carlsen in 2013; elected FIDE Deputy President in 2022.",
