    {
      "@id": "kt:illegal-move",
      "@type": "kto:Rule",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Illegal move",
      "skos:definition": "A move that breaks the piece-movement rules of the Laws of Chess; under FIDE rules it is complete once the clock is pressed, the prior position is restored, the opponent gains two minutes for a first offence and a second offence loses the game.",
